WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.818
Welcome to Module 2 of the
Provider Notices learning path:

2
00:00:03.818 --> 00:00:05.938
Azure Service Health and alerts.

3
00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:09.358
This is Gate 1 of the provider
notices implementation guide,

4
00:00:09.358 --> 00:00:12.163
with the first chapter of
the developer workbook.

5
00:00:12.163 --> 00:00:17.108
Service Health is where Azure publishes
service issues, planned maintenance, health

6
00:00:17.108 --> 00:00:21.775
advisories, retirements among them, and
security advisories for a subscription.

7
00:00:21.775 --> 00:00:25.912
In this module you read the fixture
subscriptions with the kit's query,

8
00:00:25.912 --> 00:00:28.337
built from Microsoft Learn's own samples.

9
00:00:28.337 --> 00:00:32.843
Then you plan the built-in Azure Policy
that creates Service Health alerts in

10
00:00:32.843 --> 00:00:37.700
every subscription, as a plan that changes
nothing until someone approves its hash.

11
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.963
It takes about fifty-five minutes,

12
00:00:39.963 --> 00:00:43.600
with a lab on fixtures and a
lab for a test subscription.

13
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:49.150
The code is illustrative: tested against
fixtures, not run against a live tenant.
